# Claude Code local tooling — preview-server config, session data, transcripts.
# Machine-specific and worthless to anyone else.
/.claude

# There are no dependencies (package.json has no `dependencies` key), so this
# only ever holds whatever a stray `npm install` dragged in.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
*.log

# Secrets. Defensive — nothing in this app has a credential to leak, and the one
# thing that behaves like one (courtpiece.clientId) is minted in the browser and
# never leaves localStorage. Listed anyway, because the cost of the line is zero
# and the cost of the mistake is permanent.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# OS and editor droppings. Developed on Windows, deployed to a static host, so
# both families turn up.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# NOT ignored, on purpose: icons/*.png.
#
# They are generated by `npm run icons`, which normally means "don't commit the
# output" — but there is no build step here and nothing runs on the host. GitHub
# Pages serves this directory verbatim, and manifest.webmanifest points at those
# exact files, so an icons/ that only exists on a developer's machine is a PWA
# that cannot be installed. They are committed artefacts, like index.html.
